Description: Fitted Bayesian models used by the body size and foraging range
    prediction functions in 'pollimetry'. Includes models described by
    Kendall et al. (2019) <doi:10.1002/ece3.4835> and
    Kendall et al. (2022) <doi:10.1002/ecy.3809>.
